Yeah, I think he was an early casualty, you might say, of the switch from published books that is paper books to computer documentation. And he's aware of this. I mean, because he talks about how it would be great if he could put this into a computer. Would you say that Rhinoshepa was a genius? He was a genius I think. I mean it's very impressive to see the amount of work that he did on this. And he also had that sort of crazy perseverance that you have to have. So you know that's a whole other kind of genius.
